<view class="page us-page">
  <view class="us-heading"><view><text class="us-kicker">ONLY FOR US</text><text class="us-title">只属于我们</text></view><view class="heading-actions"><button class="settings-button press" bindtap="settings">设置</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status-banner status-banner--error" role="alert"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !loaded}}" class="couple-skeleton"><view></view><view></view><text>正在确认你们的空间</text></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{couple.status === 'UNPAIRED'}}" class="invite-stage">
    <view class="invite-film"><view class="invite-photo mine">{{myInitial}}</view><view class="invite-photo waiting">TA</view><text>01 / 02</text></view>
    <view class="unpaired-title"><text>邀请 TA，</text><text>一起写下甜蜜日常。</text></view><text class="unpaired-note">配对后，你们可以分享心动瞬间、回应彼此，再把它们做成只属于两个人的回顾。</text><button class="primary-button press" bindtap="invite">邀请我的另一半</button><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="privacy">了解共享方式</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{couple.status === 'ENDED'}}" class="ended-card card"><text class="ended-mark">⌁</text><text class="section-title">情侣空间已停止访问</text><text class="section-note">你仍可在“时光”中查看自己创建的记录。对方上传的内容和原情侣回顾已隐藏。</text><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="privacy">查看隐私设置</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="relation-sunset">
      <view class="relation-light"></view><button class="relation-edit press" bindtap="openProfileEditor">编辑资料</button>
      <view class="relation-avatars"><view class="avatar mine">{{myInitial}}</view><view class="relation-heart">＋</view><view class="avatar partner">{{partnerInitial}}</view></view>
      <text class="relation-kicker">{{couple.relationshipName}}</text><view wx:if="{{days}}" class="together-line"><text>在一起</text><text class="relation-days">{{days}}</text><text>天</text></view><button wx:else class="set-anniversary press" bindtap="openProfileEditor">还没设置在一起的日期 · 现在设置</button><text class="anniversary-copy">纪念日 · {{couple.anniversary || '等你们一起定下'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="relation-editor" aria-label="编辑关系资料">
      <view class="editor-head"><view><text>编辑你们的资料</text><text class="label">双方都可以修改，保存后会同步给对方</text></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="closeProfileEditor">取消</button></view>
      <view class="editor-field"><text>关系昵称</text><input value="{{editName}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：满屿之间" bindinput="nameInput" /></view>
      <view class="editor-field"><text>纪念日 <text class="optional">可留空</text></text><picker mode="date" value="{{editAnniversary}}" bindchange="anniversaryChange"><view class="date-picker">{{editAnniversary || '选择一个值得纪念的日期'}}<text>›</text></view></picker></view>
      <view class="editor-actions"><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="clearAnniversary">清空日期</button><button class="primary-button press" loading="{{savingProfile}}" disabled="{{savingProfile}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存资料</button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="us-section-title"><text>TA 最近的回应</text><text>每一次回应，都让回忆更完整</text></view>
    <button class="love-letter-row press" bindtap="messages"><view class="letter-mark">{{unread || '✓'}}</view><view><text>{{unread ? '有新的心意等你看' : '今天的信笺已经读完'}}</text><text>{{unread ? 'TA 的回应和悄悄话都在这里' : '下一次回应会出现在这里'}}</text></view><text>›</text></button>
    <view class="shared-memory-row"><view><text>{{sharedCount}}</text><text>个共同瞬间</text></view><text>你们一起留下的甜蜜日常</text></view>
    <button class="pet-card romantic-pet press" bindtap="pet"><view class="pet-scene"><view class="pet-body"><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view><text>⌁</text></view><view class="pet-shadow"></view></view><view class="pet-copy"><text class="pet-kicker">共同养成</text><text class="pet-name">{{pet.name}} · Lv.{{pet.level}}</text><text class="label">{{pet.kind}}也在收藏你们的陪伴</text><view class="growth-track"><view class="decor" style="width: {{pet.growth}}%"></view></view></view><text class="pet-arrow">›</text></button>
    <view class="date-prompt"><text>今天也可以很值得纪念</text><text>拍下一张照片，告诉 TA 你正在想什么。</text></view>
  </block>
</view>
